diff --git a/docs/utils.rst b/docs/utils.rst
index 995c171..5289ee7 100644
--- a/docs/utils.rst
+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,10 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Set ``isolate_env=True`` to start from a fixed allowlist of platform-support
+variables instead of inheriting the complete parent environment. An explicit
+``env`` mapping is applied afterward and may add or replace any variable.
+
 
